 "_doc": "Trilingual 'TAX INVOICE / BELASTINGFAKTUUR' ledger (two pages, header repeated): Date / Description / VAT / Debit (incl VAT) / Credit / Balance, grouped by service headings, with a meter detail row under each consumption line (Date From/To, rate, Units, readings, reading type, Exclusive) and the meter id on the next line. Comma decimals with space thousands. Fingerprint: the VAT number printed in the masthead + 'Kgatelopele Local Municipality' (the same VAT number is also printed by Lekwa-Teemane's 2026 statements, so the name is required). Electricity: Elec Consumption KWH (kWh and [old to new] readings from the description, energy -> standard), Elec Consumption KVA (two kVA registers billed every month; demand_r and demand_kva are the sums of both), Elc Basic Charge (-> other); ex VAT = Debit - VAT per line. IDENTITY x_elec_resid_r = Amount Due - Balance Brought Forward + payments - non-electricity debits - (VAT Total - non-electricity VAT): 0.00 gap on all 10 bills (10 checked). One bill has no kWh line (only kVA + basic), so kWh is blank there.",
